    "keyQuotes": [
      "On behalf of Palm Island Community Company and the Elders, we will achieve something for our kids, the next generation. Build opportunity, build pathways, create jobs.",
      "I'm very happy to be here standing on Djiru Country from my grandmother. That would've been where my grandmother and my granddad were.",
      "We're not only getting the wisdom and knowledge from them, but we're getting history that we didn't even know."
